<section style="" class="row pt-3 pb-3 mt-5">
        <div style="" class="col-md-7 ">



<div class="">
<div class="mb-3"><span class="fscj-allcaps">Financial Aid</span>
</div><h2 style="color: var(--ocean-deep)">Flexible Payment Options</h2><p>Pay for college on a schedule that works for you. FSCJ offers Tuition Installment Plans (TIPs) through Nelnet, allowing you to spread tuition and fees into manageable monthly payments while attending classes. Choose from flexible payment options, with down payments and enrollment fees varying based on when you enroll.<strong></strong></p><p><a class="ocean-btn-learnMore" href="https://www.fscj.edu/student-financial-services/tips" style="font-size: inherit; text-transform: inherit; word-spacing: normal; white-space: inherit">Learn More About TIPS</a><span style="background-color: initial; font-size: inherit; text-transform: inherit; word-spacing: normal; caret-color: auto; white-space: inherit">&nbsp;</span><em class="bi bi-arrow-right"></em></p></div>
</div>
